  "content": "[Intro]\n[Eb]\n[Bb]\n[Eb]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Eb]I go out to [Ebmmaj7]work on a Monday\n[Eb]morning Tu-\nesday I go [Ebmmaj7]off to honeymoon\n[Db6][C7]I'll\n[Fm]be back again [Eb]before it's\n[Gm]time for Sunnydown, [Cm]I'll be\n[Ab]lazing on a [Bb7]Sunday after-\n[Eb]noon [Bb7][Eb]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm]Bicycling on every Wednesday\n[G]evening\n[D]Thursday I go [A/C#]waltzing to the\n[F/C]Zoo\n[F]I\n\n[Bridge]\n[Gm]come from London [Dm]town, I'm just an\n[Eb7M]ordinary\n[D]guy,\n[Eb]Fridays I go [Bb7]painting in the\n[C7][C7(#5)]Louvre I'm\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Fm]bound to be [Eb]proposing on a\n[Gm]Saturday night [Cm]I'll be\n[Ab]lazing on a [Bb]Sunday\n[Ab]lazing on a [Bb]Sunday\n[Ab]lazing on a [Bb]Sunday After-\n[Eb]noon. [Bb7][Eb]\n\n[Solo]\n[A]\n[Gm7b5]  [F#7]\n[Bm]  [A]\n[C#m]  [F#m]\n[D]  [E]\n[A]  [E7]  [A]",
